n they come in I want to add more to it is that possible T Tech Advisor Custom GemShow thinkingYes, it is possible. Since you are already using Termux:Widget, you are likely triggering scripts manually from your home screen. To expand this, you should shift from manual triggering (push) to event-driven automation (pull).In the Android/Termux environment, the primary bottleneck for automation is the Scoped Storage model and Background Execution restrictions.1. Event-Driven Automation with inotify-toolsInstead of clicking a widget to sort files, you can have a background script monitor your Downloads or Documents folder in real-time.Prerequisites:Run termux-setup-storage to ensure Termux can see /sdcard.Install the monitoring utility: pkg install inotify-tools.Logic:
The following script monitors a directory for new files (create or moved_to events). When a file appears, it checks the extension and moves it to the defined client or document folder.Bash#!/data/data/com.termux/files/usr/bin/bash
